we absolutely reached out to our users.

00:41:09.300 --> 00:41:13.126
Um, for, um, for some of our
products at Avalara, we even do,

00:41:13.126 --> 00:41:16.285
like, monthly newsletters with,
"Hey, this is what's new. Please

00:41:16.287 --> 00:41:20.671
