products, um, it's a periodic thing.

00:41:20.672 --> 00:41:24.820
It's related to a major change that's
happening within the ecosystem and

00:41:24.821 --> 00:41:26.345
wanting to get pointed feedback.

00:41:26.697 --> 00:41:30.994
Um, but absolutely reaching out to
users, um, primarily via email, though

00:41:31.016 --> 00:41:34.358
with the changes that we highlighted
