questions to ask because I had

00:41:46.929 --> 00:41:48.856
experience talking with users.

00:41:48.910 --> 00:41:51.928
I was in our support
team at Avalara one time.

00:41:52.351 --> 00:41:56.770
Um, I had helped, um, do
ride-alongs with, with users, um,

00:41:56.827 --> 00:41:58.298
getting their direct feedback.

00:41:58.572 --> 00:42:02.705
I had a lot of experience
doing, uh, user interviews and

00:42:02.759 --> 00:42:04.937
ideating the product changes.

00:42:05.261 --> 00:42:09.081
Um, uh, I managed the, the whole
e-commerce and, and small- to mid-market

00:42:09.083 --> 00:42:13.706
ERP portfolio at Avalara, so I have a lot
