00:42:15.762 --> 00:42:18.646
Uh, that experience you do gain over time.

00:42:18.940 --> 00:42:25.034
Um, I also did research, um, looking
at what typical, um, pitfalls there

00:42:25.036 --> 00:42:29.750
were, um, related to the keywords
that we were seeing within our cases.

00:42:30.072 --> 00:42:33.801
So if you think about, you know,
searching, like, different community

00:42:33.802 --> 00:42:37.024
sites, when these words come up,
what are the ki- types of things

00:42:37.026 --> 00:42:38.273
that users are talking about?

00:42:38.567 --> 00:42:43.499
Um, so I also expanded my search to do
research, um, outside of just the direct

00:42:43.502 --> 00:42:48.698
case, direct feedback to see, um, w- how
that manifested in the ecosystem as well.

00:42:50.977 --> 00:42:57.883
